    "provinceDeepAtlasProfile": {
      "oneLine": "Gruddirynn is centered at -72.283919, 77.633589 under Aristocracy, with 30,515,000 people across 11 settlements.",
      "extremeAtlasDescription": "Gruddirynn occupies 5,469,689.61 sq mi / 14,166,431.07 sq km of modeled Earth-sized territory, about 2.777373% of Belavadös's surface. It is not merely a province but a continent-scale civic machine: Beach and grass with water, Beach and reefs with water and Partial forest define its broad terrain, while its settlements intensify into Beach and grass with water, Beach and reefs with water, Farming and Ocean Surface floating settlement. Population density is 2.154 people/sq km / 5.579 people/sq mi, which lets wilderness, roads, faction-held corridors, and vast uncrowded borders remain huge.",
      "peopleFactionsAndFaith": "The strongest public people-groups are Humans, Near-Humans, and Mixed Heritage, Halfling and Smallfolk, Animalfolk and Mammalian Anthropomorphs, Elf Parent Race and Elf Bloodlines, Amphibious and Aquatic Peoples, Draconic and Reptilian Races, and 2 more. Frequently recorded peoples include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Elf — Sea Elf, Tortle, Genasi — Water Genasi, Hadozee, Triton, Merfolk, and 4 more. Faction visibility leans toward The Cog-Sanctum Synod, with worship and patronage records naming Nebyrr, Ishtanora, Iskareth, Marduthor, Sigrananna, Setrimir, Bastveig, and 3 more.",
